---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <div
    style="max-width: 800px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 2rem; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif; background-color: #fff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);"
  >
    {/* Logo & Title */}
    <a href="/" style="text-decoration: none;">
      <div
        style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"
      >
        <img
          src="/images/main/brand-logo.png"
          alt="Planethimalayas Logo"
          style="height: 50px; margin-right: 10px;"
        />
        <h2
          style="font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1.8rem; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px;"
        >
          <span style="color: black;">Planet</span
          ><span style="color: #ff7300;">himalayas</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
    </a>

    <h1
      style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 2rem; text-align: center;"
    >
      <span style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Privacy Policy</span>
    </h1>

    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      This privacy policy explains how Planethimalayas collects, uses, and safeguards the information you
      provide when using this website. Planethimalayas is committed to protecting your privacy. When we
      request personal information that can identify you, rest assured it will only be used as outlined in
      this policy.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6;">
      We may update this privacy policy periodically. We encourage you to review this page occasionally
      to stay informed about any changes.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color: #ff7300; margin-top: 1.5rem;">1. What We Collect</h2>
    <ul style="margin-left: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <li>Name and job title</li>
      <li>Contact details including email address and phone number</li>
      <li>Demographic information such as postal code, interests, and preferences</li>
      <li>Information related to customer surveys and offers</li>
      <li>
        Document proof such as PAN, Aadhar, Driving License, Passport, etc., when required for
        identification or verification
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="color: #ff7300; margin-top: 1.5rem;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul style="margin-left: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <li>Maintaining internal records</li>
      <li>Improving our products and services</li>
      <li>
        Sending periodic promotional emails regarding new products, offers, or other information we
        believe may interest you
      </li>
      <li>Contacting you for market research via email, phone, fax, or mail</li>
      <li>Customizing the website experience according to your interests</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="color: #ff7300; margin-top: 1.5rem;">3. Security</h2>
    <p style="line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      We prioritize securing your information. Physical, electronic, and managerial procedures are in
      place to prevent unauthorized access, disclosure, or misuse of your data.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color: #ff7300; margin-top: 1.5rem;">4. Cookies</h2>
    <p style="line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      Cookies are small files placed on your device to help analyze web traffic and improve your browsing
      experience. We use cookies to identify which pages are used most, understand user preferences, and
      enhance the functionality of our website. You can accept or decline cookies via your browser
      settings. Declining cookies may limit your ability to use certain website features.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color: #ff7300; margin-top: 1.5rem;">5. Links to Other Websites</h2>
    <p style="line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      Our website may contain links to external websites. We do not control these websites and cannot be
      responsible for the privacy or security of any information you provide there. Please review the
      privacy policies of any external sites you visit.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color: #ff7300; margin-top: 1.5rem;">6. Controlling Your Personal Information</h2>
    <ul style="margin-left: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <li>
        Opt-out of sharing your personal information for direct marketing by checking the appropriate box
        on forms.
      </li>
      <li>
        Withdraw consent for the use of your personal data for marketing purposes by contacting us at
        <a
          href="mailto:info@planethimalayas.com"
          style="color: #ff7300; text-decoration: underline;"
          >info@planethimalayas.com</a
        >.
      </li>
      <li>
        We will not sell, lease, or distribute your personal data to third parties without your permission
        unless required by law.
      </li>
      <li>
        Request a copy of personal information held about you. A small fee may apply. Requests can be sent
        to
        <a
          href="mailto:info@planethimalayas.com"
          style="color: #ff7300; text-decoration: underline;"
          >info@planethimalayas.com</a
        >.
      </li>
      <li>
        Correct any inaccurate or incomplete personal information by contacting us promptly.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="color: #ff7300; margin-top: 1.5rem;">7. Contact Us</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      For any questions regarding this privacy policy, you can reach us at:
    </p>
    <p style="line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1.1rem;">
      Telephone: <strong>+91 90072 10399 / +91 90274 81187</strong><br />
      Email:
      <a
        href="mailto:info@planethimalayas.com"
        style="color: #ff7300; text-decoration: underline;"
        >info@planethimalayas.com</a
      >
    </p>
  </div>
</html>
